The layouts and mods under config/ are derived from Herdr App v0.1.16
(https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr-app/tree/v0.1.16), Apache-2.0 (see LICENSE).

Changes:
- layouts: the system title bar (Sway draws no window buttons), no terminal
  padding or outer pane frames, gray split dividers, the Eighties theme, and
  eighties-pane as the pane header.
- eighties-pane (from pane): a blue focus underline and title; until when an
  idle agent's prompt cache stays warm; icons copied into the mod.
- eighties-terminals-bar (from terminals-bar): theme() tokens instead of
  hardcoded colours; until when an idle agent's prompt cache stays warm;
  icons copied into the mod.

When bumping Herdr, diff each mod against its upstream mod and each layout
against upstream's main and terminals.
